dec_app 10
dec_app 11
dec_app 1100
---
OK n=1 null
OK n=1 bool 0
OK n=1 bool 1
OK n=1 bool 1
### null-boolean-decode-malformed null boolean decode malformed
# null with contents; boolean LVT must be 0 or 1; boolean in extended form
dec_app 0100
dec_app 12
dec_app 14
dec_app 1501
---
ERR
ERR
ERR
ERR

